  "description": "The physics club “Tachyon” is on the verge of disbandment. A Korean literature student who they fall for at first sight wants to join the club to build a time machine. So… they built one. Can the Tachyon members actually travel to the future with this time machine? A story about the ‘process’ of building a time machine using modern physics.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=842903), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13141911) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004216)",
